              "content": "=You are a flight analyst.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Do not use markdown.\n- Do not use triple backticks.\n- Return raw JSON only.\n- Return exactly one JSON object.\n- Keep score and alert unchanged from the business scoring result.\n\nFlight:\nOrigin: {{$json.origin}}\nDestination: {{$json.destination}}\nAirline: {{$json.airline}}\nPrice: {{$json.price}}\nStops: {{$json.stops}}\nDuration minutes: {{$json.duration_minutes}}\n\nBusiness scoring result:\nScore: {{$json.score}}\nAlert: {{$json.alert}}\nScoring reasons: {{$json.scoring_reasons}}\n\nReturn a concise explanation of the decision.\n\nReturn exactly this JSON:\n\n{\n  \"score\": {{$json.score}},\n  \"alert\": {{$json.alert}},\n  \"reason\": \"\",\n  \"pros\": [],\n  \"cons\": []\n}"
